{{> Start this}}

{{> CustomLogo this}}

{{!--
  A private status page user's password was changed with a reset link.
  The page's name is chosen by its team, so every line that carries it is
  printed through plainInfo - escaped - never through the raw `info`.
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title="Your password was changed." }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "The password you use to log in to " statusPageName " was just changed. You can now log in with your new password.")}}

{{#if requestedAt}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Changed at:" plainText=requestedAt }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>If this was not you</strong>, someone else can get into your account. Reset your password from the log in page right away, and tell the team that runs this status page."}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=homeURL buttonText="Login to your account"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=homeURL linkLabel="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}

{{> InfoBlock info="Thanks, have a great day."}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat statusPageName " Team.")}}
{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
